      <title>Effect of an AI clinical decision support chatbot on care quality in rural Uganda</title>
      <scientificTitle>Effect of an AI clinical decision support chatbot on care quality in rural Ugandan primary health centres: a cluster-randomised controlled trial</scientificTitle>
      <acronym/>
      <studyHypothesis/>
      <plainEnglishSummary>Background and study aims
In rural Uganda, many people get primary care from small clinics staffed by a single nurse. This study aims to find out whether giving nurses access to the chatbot improves the quality of care they provide.

